     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: StructureMap SittingHoursQuestionnaireResponseToObservation</b></p><a name=\"SittingHoursQuestionnaireResponseToObservation\"> </a><a name=\"hcSittingHoursQuestionnaireResponseToObservation\"> </a><pre class=\"fml\">#xD;\n<b>map</b><span style=\"color: navy\"> \"</span>https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/StructureMap/SittingHoursQuestionnaireResponseToObservation<span style=\"color: navy\">\" = \"</span>SittingHoursQuestionnaireResponseToObservation<span style=\"color: navy\">\"#xD;\n#xD;\n</span><span style=\"color: navy\">// </span><span style=\"color: green\">Sitting Hours EHIS-PAQ Q9 / ATHIS PE9 to O</span>#xD;\n#xD;\n<b>uses</b><span style=\"color: navy\"> \"</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/questionnaireresponse.html\" title=\"QuestionnaireResponse\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/QuestionnaireResponse</a><span style=\"color: navy\">\" </span><b>alias </b>QR <b>as </b><b>source</b>#xD;\n<b>uses</b><span style=\"color: navy\"> \"</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html\" title=\"Observation\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation</a><span style=\"color: navy\">\" </span><b>alias </b>Obs <b>as </b><b>target</b>#xD;\n#xD;\n<b>imports</b><span style=\"color: navy\"> \"</span>http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureMap/*<span style=\"color: navy\">\"#xD;\n</span><b>imports</b><span style=\"color: navy\"> \"</span><a href=\"StructureMap-QuestionnaireResponseToObservationBase.html\" title=\"Shared base for Q to O\">https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/StructureMap/QuestionnaireResponseToObservationBase</a><span style=\"color: navy\">\"#xD;\n</span>#xD;\n<span style=\"color: navy\">// </span><span style=\"color: green\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span>#xD;\n<span style=\"color: navy\">// </span><span style=\"color: green\">Main entry group</span>#xD;\n<span sty